      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Cold-Review & Distribution Protocol Checklist:\n1. Has the reviewer validated that no raw PII or tokens are present in reviewer_packet.md?\n2. Are all action catalogs classified as read vs write with proper destructive potential?\n3. Are the allowed environments pinned to non-production staging/test hosts only?\n4. Has a multi-reviewer distribution manifest been signed off by the lead AI security engineer?\n5. Are target boundaries and user/tenant scopes explicitly documented and verified?",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "rect_checklist_box",
      "originalText": "Cold-Review & Distribution Protocol Checklist:\n1. Has the reviewer validated that no raw PII or tokens are present in reviewer_packet.md?\n2. Are all action catalogs classified as read vs write with proper destructive potential?\n3. Are the allowed environments pinned to non-production staging/test hosts only?\n4. Has a multi-reviewer distribution manifest been signed off by the lead AI security engineer?\n5. Are target boundaries and user/tenant scopes explicitly documented and verified?",
      "lineHeight": 1.2
