      "text": "adopt-redthread is a fully operational Context Bridge (v0 spec) and Approved Context Replay v1 engine.\nReplay evaluation uses the sibling RedThread virtualenv by default. Primary focus is making the reviewer-facing evidence path unmistakably clear.\nConfirmatory exploitation, confirmed findings, and severity scoring are strictly deferred downstream to RedThread.",
